    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>The touched living creature regains 2d8 hit points each round for the spell's duration. It may act, fight, and cast spells normally while healing. The spell closes wounds, fades bruises, and sets broken bones, but does not restore severed limbs or ruined organs.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Apply the 2d8 healing once per round manually; the spell does not schedule recurring healing.</p>"
    },
